      <activity id="36cc476a-a6ef-5c1d-b18d-ccf1af9d1d8a" activityNameId="29b37af4-0ac9-56ea-999b-a6b403e27323" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, softwood, planed, kiln dried, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, softwood, planed, kiln dried, at plant
The multi-output process "planing, softwood, kiln dried, u=10%" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber, softwood, planed, kiln dried, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, from planing, softwood, kiln dried, u=10%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: be2a8281-5c7d-3c86-99b9-6d8ee7ce1392
Includes planing process. planing mill is assumed to be located on the sawmill site. No transports are considered. Dust emissions are neglected for a lack of data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany (1986)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the German technology mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_be2a8281-5c7d-3c86-99b9-6d8ee7ce1392.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
